t=3D"" width=3D"468"></span><br><br><br><strong>Rendering Access Control</s=
trong></p>
<p>We need to prevent the rendering of sections of the UI based on user acc=
ess.<br><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded=
